Package: ai.operit
Name: Operit2 (device automation, rootless)
Version: 0.3.48
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Operit2 iOS device-automation substrate for rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine), with the Operit2 Flutter UI bundled in. Screenshot, OCR, touch/input and device automation are delegated to the ios-mcp backend running on the device.
 .
 This build integrates the following third-party open-source packages (none omitted); source links below:
  - ElleKit — rootless tweak injection libraries & loader (by opa334)
    https://github.com/opa334/ElleKit
  - ios-mcp — MCP server for AI-driven iOS device control (by witchan)
    https://github.com/witchan/ios-mcp
 .
 Acknowledgements (感谢):
  Special thanks to opa334 for ElleKit, the rootless hooking substrate that
  makes this tweak possible, and to witchan for ios-mcp, whose device-control
  MCP server powers Operit2's screenshot/OCR/automation layer. Operit2 would
  not function without these excellent open-source components. License texts
  for both packages are in THIRD_PARTY (installed at
  /var/jb/usr/share/doc/ai.operit/THIRD_PARTY).
Maintainer: operit2-ios <local@example.com>
Author: operit2-ios
Section: Utilities
Depends: ellekit, com.witchan.ios-mcp
Tag: cydia::compatible::ios15
